" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c138e79e69852f73c5d8d62bcc01cfaeaeb160d75072882928b7f2f20f0df35" "basis" 650 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-19027" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "{90}^{∘}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c138e79e69852f73c5d8d62bcc01cfaeaeb160d75072882928b7f2f20f0df35" "basis" 650 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-19027" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{36.87}^{∘}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c138e79e69852f73c5d8d62bcc01cfaeaeb160d75072882928b7f2f20f0df35" "basis" 650 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-19037" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the angle between $a=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ and $b=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c138e79e69852f73c5d8d62bcc01cfaeaeb160d75072882928b7f2f20f0df35" "basis" 650 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-19037" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Rearranging the dot product formula, we have: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,a\\,||\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot (-1)+3\\cdot 2}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{3}^{2}}\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{11}{\\sqrt{14}\\cdot \\sqrt{9}} \\\\  & =\\frac{11}{3\\sqrt{14}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{11}{3\\sqrt{14}})≈{11.49}^{∘}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c138e79e69852f73c5d8d62bcc01cfaeaeb160d75072882928b7f2f20f0df35" "basis" 650 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-19037" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3c4ae64d9a3b82d1d472628be6b7d38a56c75262d035fbf1513196b1932ceac9" "basis" 650 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-19037" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c138e79e69852f73c5d8d62bcc01cfaeaeb160d75072882928b7f2f20f0df35" "basis" 650 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13964292/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-19037" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "{11.49}^{∘}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jak